MicroDuck model provenance
==========================

The robot geometry, kinematic dimensions, inertial parameters and mesh assets are
derived from:

  Pollen Robotics / microduck_rl
  https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl

The exact source revision is recorded in the generated Xacro header and project
artifact inventory. The upstream README states that project code is Apache-2.0
and that "3D model files are licensed under Creative Commons BY-SA-NC". It does
not identify a Creative Commons license version. This repository does not infer
or silently add one.

The ROS packaging, generator, launch files and validation scripts are separate
Apache-2.0 contributions. Upstream mesh terms continue to apply to the meshes.
